# Keep the build context to what the image needs. Without this, a developer machine's node_modules and .venv
# (built for Windows/macOS) overwrite the Linux ones inside the image, and .env would be sent to the builder.
.git
.github
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
frontend/dist
loadtest
*.log
